# Ignored files Afluent's own commands regenerate, which `kanban worktree finish` may delete
# (.gitignore syntax). Anything else ignored, such as a .env, still keeps a worktree.
# `just spm-test` resolves the root package; its resolution is not committed.
/Package.resolved
# `just bench-simulated`: the harness copy, toolchain stamp and lock, per machine.
Benchmarks/.harness/
# `just bench-simulated`: the run's results before they are recorded as the `simulated` baseline.
Benchmarks/.benchmarkBaselines/*/simulated-current/
